<title>USA: Met-Coil says Blakeman steps down as CEO.</title>
<headline>Met-Coil says Blakeman steps down as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Met-Coil Systems Corp said Raymond Blakeman will step down as chief executive effective December 31, but will remain chairman.</p>
<p>An executive committee will manage the company's affairs until a new chief executive is named. Appointed to the committee were Blakeman, vice president James Heitt, chief financial officer Joseph Ceryanec and outside directors Roy Carver and Michael Nonnennmann, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
